{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おつぽ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒い日が続いるけど皆さん元気ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先週は 東京も大雪だったね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その日は、行動出来なかったから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家で映画たくさんみてたの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/01/25/8895234/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観たいDVDが沢山あるので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年はなるべく空いた時間は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山映画鑑賞をしようって目標たてたの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"既に観たい映画のリストをあげたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"60本ほどあったよ、、！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/01/25/8895234/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お勧めの映画ってありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"教えてください(｡･ω･)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きのうから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"九州も大雪みたいですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実家の方は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めったに雪が降らないから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな大騒ぎだったみたいで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族から"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん雪の写真が送られてきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/01/25/8895234/0002.gif","